%%{init: {'sequence': {'wrap': true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box Curator side
    participant OFAC as OFAC SDN list<br/>(published file)
    actor Curator as Curator ring authority
    participant CurRing as Curator ring program
    end
    box Shared rails
    participant SPP as SPP<br/>(policy agnostic)
    participant Photon as Photon indexer
    participant Prover as Prover
    end
    box Subscriber side
    participant SubRing as Subscriber ring program
    actor SubOp as Subscriber ring authority
    actor Crazy as Mr. Crazy's wallet
    participant Others as Other subscriber rings
    end

    rect rgba(100, 160, 100, 0.08)
    Note over SubRing, Crazy: baseline, a transfer to a clean recipient
    Crazy->>SubRing: reads the source map, Block resolves to the curator's records PDA
    Crazy->>Photon: reads the recipient member's record, none exists
    Photon-->>Crazy: address non-inclusion proof and both roots
    Crazy->>Prover: one proof over the audit statement, policy_hash, both roots
    Note over Crazy: every live output owner is screened, the sender's change too
    Crazy->>+SubRing: transact(proof, root indices)
    Note over SubRing: recomputes POLICY.hash over the stored map, resolves the roots by index, verifies one Groth16
    SubRing->>-SPP: CPI ring_transact
    Note over SPP: the instruction carries no member, no kind, no pool, the chain cannot tell who was screened
    end

    rect rgba(180, 100, 100, 0.08)
    Note over OFAC, CurRing: the ban, one write
    Note over OFAC: the list names Mr. Evil's address, the curator ingests it off chain
    Curator->>Prover: proves the record mutation
    Curator->>+CurRing: create_record(Block, member)<br/>member = hash(confidential view tag)
    Note over CurRing: an ed25519 tag equals the pubkey, a P256 identity hashes its x coordinate, an address ban does not cover it
    CurRing->>-SPP: CPI transact signed by the records PDA, carrying its own SPP proof
    Photon->>SPP: polls the chain, indexes the record
    Note over Photon: a plaintext zero amount UTXO at the claimed address, v0 Active, publicly auditable
    Note over Others: the same record now governs every subscriber, no further write exists
    Note over SPP: not instant, the forester rolls roots forward and the eight root window still admits pre ban proofs
    end

    rect rgba(180, 100, 100, 0.08)
    Note over Crazy: the same transfer, the recipient is Mr. Evil
    Crazy->>Photon: reads the member's record
    Photon-->>Crazy: live Active Block record
    alt honest wallet
        Note over Crazy: the SPP proof is already made, build_pool refuses with PolicyRuleUnsatisfied, nothing reaches the chain, the input UTXO stays unspent
    else patched wallet
        Crazy->>Prover: forged witness
        Note over Prover: unsatisfiable, coverage forces an answered pool entry and no absence branch exists against a live Active record
    end
    end

    rect rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.07)
    Note over SubRing, SubOp: no local override
    SubOp->>SubRing: create_record(Block, member) on the subscriber's own ring
    SubRing-->>SubOp: ForeignRecordSource, the kind is served by the curator's records
    end

    rect rgba(100, 160, 100, 0.08)
    Note over Curator, CurRing: the clear
    Curator->>CurRing: update_record, v1 Cleared at the same address, no delete exists
    Crazy->>Photon: reads the member's record
    Photon-->>Crazy: cleared record, inclusion plus nullifier non-inclusion
    Crazy->>SubRing: the same input UTXO lands through the cleared branch
    end

    rect rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.07)
    Note over Curator, SubOp: the real escape is the subscriber's, not the sanctions list's
    Curator->>CurRing: re-bans the member, v2 Active
    SubOp->>SubRing: set_policy_source(Block, own) by the config authority
    Note over SubRing: allowed only while the stored hash reproduces under the deployed table, the next transfer lands with the curator record Active
    end
